<title>USA: CCC buys 4,100 tonnes U.S. HRW wheat for Bosnia.</title>
<headline>CCC buys 4,100 tonnes U.S. HRW wheat for Bosnia.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corp said it bought 4,100 tonnes of U.S. hard red winter wheat for donation to Bosnia.</p>
<p>The CCC, which is part of the U.S. Department of Agriculture, said the wheat was purchased from Cargill Inc at $148.58 a tonne, FOB for delivery during the period of August 15 to September 5.</p>
<p>((Doris Frankel 312-983-7305))</p>
